# Never copy your local node_modules into the build context — we run
# a fresh "npm ci" inside the container instead. Copying this would be
# enormous (often 500MB+) and pointless, since it gets reinstalled
# anyway. It can also cause real bugs: some npm packages compile
# native code specific to your OS (Windows), which won't work inside
# the Linux-based container.
node_modules/
dist/
.angular/

.git/
.gitignore
README.md